---
import "../../styles/animations.css";
---

<figure class="an-wrap">
  <svg class="an iv" viewBox="0 0 480 218" role="img" aria-label="Each purchase takes one unit until the stock is zero, then purchases are refused"><rect class="nd " x="16" y="50" width="110" height="70" rx="12"/><text class="b" x="82.0" y="75" text-anchor="middle">Buyers</text><rect class="nd " x="190" y="30" width="140" height="110" rx="12"/><image href="/images/ruvio-mark-128.png" x="200" y="39" width="22" height="22"/><text class="b" x="271.0" y="55" text-anchor="middle">stock:42</text><path class="ln" d="M126 85 L190 85"/><g class="iv-w0"><text class="b" x="270" y="108" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:30px">3</text></g><g class="iv-w1"><text class="b" x="270" y="108" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:30px">2</text></g><g class="iv-w2"><text class="b" x="270" y="108" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:30px">1</text></g><g class="iv-w3"><text class="b" x="270" y="108" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:30px">0</text></g><text class="sm m" x="270" y="128" text-anchor="middle">left</text><g class="iv-w4"><circle class="pk" cx="126" cy="85" r="5" fill="var(--ok)" style="--dx:64px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/></g><g class="iv-w5"><circle class="pk" cx="126" cy="85" r="5" fill="var(--bad)" style="--dx:64px;--dy:0px;animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:1.0s!important;"/></g><g class="iv-w6"><text class="sm" x="360" y="92" style="fill:var(--bad)">✕ sold out</text></g><rect class="cap" x="16" y="176" width="448" height="38" rx="10"/><g class="iv-w4"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle">Each TAKE removes one unit atomically.</text></g><g class="iv-w5"><text x="240.0" y="200" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--bad)">Stock is 0: the next TAKE is refused.</text></g><g class="iv-w6 an-fin"></g></svg>
  <figcaption><b>Stock that never goes below zero</b>TAKE removes an amount only when enough is left, so overselling cannot happen.</figcaption>
</figure>
